{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDoveDays : Time Flies\u300b is a compact and addictive casual puzzle game. It combines many classic games with some stress-relieving mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are designed to be intuitive, with multiple solutions available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is perfect for gamers who enjoy a relaxed gaming experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can skip levels at will.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints are available at any time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where should the tools be placed? How to solve the problem of non-adjacent colors? How should the blocks be arranged!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I need to eliminate the red dot on my phone! It's so annoying!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the game to enjoy a peaceful world, a relaxing puzzle game that's easy on the mind, and some challenging puzzles waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDoveDays : Time Flies\u201d features countless levels for you to discover, ensuring stress relief all the way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/extras/61dc508c7f4f6370fc9eef577ff1b20e.poster.avif?t=1756568976\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/extras/61dc508c7f4f6370fc9eef577ff1b20e.webm?t=1756568976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/extras/61dc508c7f4f6370fc9eef577ff1b20e.mp4?t=1756568976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to play a specific series of games? Want to keep playing a relaxing game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDoveDays : Time Flies\u201d offers a casual mode, allowing you to play various similar levels and relaxing levels. It's pure bliss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/extras/41fda1198dbe70f52d5cf2dacb3e7643.poster.avif?t=1756568976\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/extras/41fda1198dbe70f52d5cf2dacb3e7643.webm?t=1756568976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/extras/41fda1198dbe70f52d5cf2dacb3e7643.mp4?t=1756568976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We hope it brings you joy and relaxation!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Addictive short level design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Diverse casual puzzle gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Average of a few minutes per level, perfect for utilizing spare time to unwind and refresh your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2f Smooth difficulty curve, easy to pick up, gradually getting better, with a sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Cute art style and soothing color palette create a relaxed puzzle-solving atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 No complicated setup required\u2014enjoy puzzle-solving fun anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0f You can skip levels at any time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 Addictive sound effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969570?t=1756568976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/98871b54abb2a8c7b96c58c76cc52a7f52ce63b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756568976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/fc5f9e2200ca5345d6ea07dfa7017846e82120ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756568976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969570/fc5f9e2200ca5345d6ea07dfa7017846e82120ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756568976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aDoveDays : Time Flies\u300b is a compact and addictive casual puzzle game. It combines many classic games with some stress-relieving mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are designed to be intuitive, with multiple solutions available.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is perfect for gamers who enjoy a relaxed gaming experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul c